{"n":5,"turn":3,"phase":"choosing","actions":["switched to Venusaur  // Extreme Speed is a 0x into a Ghost and I'm Choice-locked, so staying is a free turn for them. Venusaur is the one switch-in a status team cannot break: immune to Toxic and poison, and burn barely dents a special attacker. Chlorophyll puts it at 264 Speed in this sun, faster than Gengar.","Gengar used Sludge Wave  // Sludge Wave covers every branch: it kills a 39% Arcanine if it stays, and it is 2x on Venusaur, Victreebel and Exeggutor - three of their five remaining bodies - hitting them the instant they switch in."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 4 —"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Arcanine, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Venusaur!"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Gengar used Sludge Wave!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Venusaur took 123 damage."},{"type":"item","side":1,"text":"Gengar was hurt by its Life Orb! (-13)"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":4,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(4)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149,"status":"sleep"},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":123,"max_hp":136,"active":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":182,"max_hp":182}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":6,"turn":4,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Venusaur used Sleep Powder  // Venusaur at 33 dies to the next Sludge Wave regardless, so I spend its last action on the biggest swing available. Chlorophyll has me at 264 vs Gengar's 178, so Sleep Powder goes first: a 75% shot at deleting their fastest attacker and buying Exeggutor a free entry to Psychic it.","Gengar used Sludge Wave  // Venusaur at 21% is dead to another Sludge Wave, and Gengar resists both its STABs at 0.5x - Chlorophyll outspeeding me does not matter when nothing it throws can break 123 HP."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 5 —"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Venusaur used Sleep Powder!"},{"type":"status","side":1,"text":"Gengar was put to sleep!"},{"type":"status","side":1,"text":"Gengar is fast asleep."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":5,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(3)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149,"status":"sleep"},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":123,"max_hp":136,"status":"sleep","active":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":182,"max_hp":182}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":7,"turn":5,"phase":"choosing","actions":["switched to Ninetales  // My predecessor lost this team's whole identity by never getting the sun back. Gengar asleep is the safest reset window I will get: Ninetales re-triggers Drought for 8 turns off Heat Rock, wakes on entry because the earlier pivot zeroed its sleep counter, and is then in range to Fire Blast the napping Gengar.","switched to Golbat  // A sleeping Gengar is a free Growth for Venusaur, and +2 breaks even the resisted hit. Golbat takes Grass at 0.25x and Poison at 0.5x - Venusaur literally cannot dent it - and Air Slash is 2x to finish a 21% body."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 6 —"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Venusaur, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Ninetales!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Gengar, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Golbat!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":6,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(2)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149,"status":"sleep","active":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":123,"max_hp":136,"status":"sleep"},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":182,"max_hp":182,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":8,"turn":6,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Ninetales used Nasty Plot  // Golbat is a Roost + Sitrus pivot, so two 116-damage Fire Blasts lose to its recovery while one +2 Fire Blast (~232) does not. Golbat's answer to me is Toxic, not damage, so the setup turn is cheap. Ninetales outspeeds it 167 to 110 and cashes the boost next turn while the sun is still up.","Golbat used Poison Fang  // Ninetales is asleep and cannot punish me, so I spend the free turn on Poison Fang's 50% bad-poison roll. Putting the Drought setter on a permanent clock is what caps their sun at this one dying cycle."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 7 —"},{"type":"status","side":0,"text":"Ninetales woke up!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Ninetales used Nasty Plot!"},{"type":"stat","side":0,"text":"Ninetales's Sp. Atk rose sharply!"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Golbat used Poison Fang!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Ninetales took 33 damage."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":7,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(1)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":116,"max_hp":149,"active":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":123,"max_hp":136,"status":"sleep"},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":182,"max_hp":182,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":9,"turn":7,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Ninetales used Fire Blast  // Last turn of sun and the boost is live: +2 STAB Fire Blast in sunlight is roughly 232 into a ~160 HP Golbat, which overruns both Sitrus and Roost in one action. Cash it now — next turn the sky goes out and the same move drops to ~155.","Golbat used Confuse Ray  // A +2 sun Fire Blast OHKOs every body I own, so I am losing one this turn no matter what - switching would only waste the action too. Golbat is my most redundant wall, so it stays and buys the 15% branch where Fire Blast misses and a +2 Ninetales ends up confused."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 8 —"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Ninetales used Fire Blast!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Golbat took 182 damage."},{"type":"faint","side":1,"text":"Golbat fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight faded."}],"after":{"turn":8,"phase":"replace","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":116,"max_hp":149,"active":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":123,"max_hp":136,"status":"sleep"},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
