{"n":11,"turn":8,"phase":"choosing","actions":["switched to Victreebel  // Gengar's sleep counter was zeroed by its own switch-out, so it wakes and moves first at 178 to my 167 — Sludge Wave is a coin-flip to kill Ninetales and I will not gamble the only Drought on my team. Victreebel's Focus Sash guarantees it lives the hit, and Sucker Punch is Dark and 2x back, which after Life Orb recoil is lethal on Gengar.","Gengar used Sludge Wave  // Gengar wakes on this move attempt and moves first at 178 speed. Sludge Wave rolls 108-127 into Ninetales' 111 HP - killing the Drought setter ends any chance of a second sun and erases the +2 in one action."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 9 —"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Ninetales, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Victreebel!"},{"type":"status","side":1,"text":"Gengar woke up!"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Gengar used Sludge Wave!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Victreebel took 155 damage."},{"type":"item","side":0,"text":"Victreebel hung on with its Focus Sash!"},{"type":"crit","side":1,"text":"A critical hit!"},{"type":"item","side":1,"text":"Gengar was hurt by its Life Orb! (-13)"}],"after":{"turn":9,"phase":"choosing","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":116,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":110,"max_hp":136,"active":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":12,"turn":9,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Victreebel used Sucker Punch  // The only move that resolves before a 178-Speed Gengar. Sucker Punch is Dark into a Ghost for ~136 against its ~107 remaining, so it kills on every roll if Gengar attacks — and if Gengar instead clicks a status move, Sucker Punch whiffs but Victreebel takes zero damage. There is no line where this loses me anything.","Gengar used Sludge Wave  // Their switch threw away the +2 Nasty Plot entirely. Off-sun Gengar's 178 outruns their whole roster, and Sludge Wave now kills Victreebel, Venusaur, Arcanine, Exeggutor or Ninetales - five of six switch-ins die to this one click."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 10 —"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Victreebel used Sucker Punch!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Gengar took 110 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":0,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"faint","side":1,"text":"Gengar fainted!"}],"after":{"turn":10,"phase":"replace","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":116,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
