{"n":14,"turn":10,"phase":"choosing","actions":["switched to Ninetales  // Sun has actually lapsed now, so Drought will really fire this time. Arbok is the safest thing on their roster to re-enter against — Intimidate/Rocky Helmet/Glare, base 65 SpA, no real damage. I need the sky back before Zapdos arrives: unsunned Charizard does ~99 to Zapdos and Roost heals 99, which is a stalemate I lose. Sunned it does ~223.","Arbok used Glare  // Glare is a status move, so Victreebel's Sucker Punch fails outright and Power Whip just kills it on my Rocky Helmet. If they pivot instead, the paralysis lands on the switch-in - and halving speed is how I dismantle a team whose whole creed is being fastest."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 11 —"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Victreebel, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Ninetales!"},{"type":"ability","side":0,"text":"Ninetales's ability set the weather!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight turned harsh!"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Arbok used Glare!"},{"type":"status","side":0,"text":"Ninetales was paralyzed!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":11,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(7)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":116,"max_hp":149,"status":"paralysis","active":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167,"active":true},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":15,"turn":11,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Ninetales used Fire Blast  // Ninetales is already paralysed, which makes it status-proof — Arbok's Glare has nothing left to do here. That makes it the right body to grind Arbok down with, and it keeps Glare away from Charizard, whose 167-to-120 speed edge over Zapdos is the whole endgame. Sun Fire Blast chips ~126 and shows me Arbok's attacking move.","Arbok used Earthquake  // My own Glare bought this: paralysis drops Ninetales to 83 and Arbok's 100 now moves first. Earthquake is 2x into Fire and rolls 119-140 into 111 HP - a guaranteed kill on the Drought engine, so this third sun is their last."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 12 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Arbok used Earthquake!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Ninetales took 116 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":1,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"faint","side":0,"text":"Ninetales fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":12,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(6)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":0,"max_hp":149,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167,"active":true},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":16,"turn":12,"phase":"replace","actions":["switched to Exeggutor  // Exeggutor is the hard answer to what just killed me: Grass resists Ground, so Earthquake drops from a 2x kill to a 0.5x scratch. Chlorophyll puts it at 214 over Arbok's ~100, Psychic is 2x into a pure Poison-type, and it is non-contact so Rocky Helmet never gets to bite back.",""],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Exeggutor!"}],"after":{"turn":12,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(6)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":0,"max_hp":149,"fainted":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171,"active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":197,"max_hp":197},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167,"active":true},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":17,"turn":12,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Exeggutor used Psychic  // Psychic into a pure Poison-type at 2x, from 214 Speed so it lands before Arbok can move. This should remove the Earthquake that just took my sun setter, and it costs Exeggutor nothing on the return since Ground is resisted and Psychic avoids Rocky Helmet.","switched to Zapdos  // Exeggutor's Psychic is 2x on Poison and OHKOs Arbok from behind Chlorophyll speed, so Arbok cannot stay. Zapdos eats Grass at 0.25x and Psychic for only ~108 of 197, and it is the body that answers Charizard, Venusaur and Victreebel too."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 13 —"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Arbok, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Zapdos!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor used Psychic!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Zapdos took 93 damage."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."},{"type":"item","side":1,"text":"Zapdos restored a little HP (Leftovers, +12)."}],"after":{"turn":13,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(5)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":0,"max_hp":149,"fainted":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171,"active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":116,"max_hp":197,"active":true},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":18,"turn":13,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Exeggutor used Psychic  // I cannot win a 93-per-turn grind against a 99-point Roost, so I stop trying to and instead force the Roost. This drops Zapdos to about 23, where a faster Exeggutor means Roosting is its only non-losing move — and a turn it spends healing is a turn it deals no damage, which is exactly the free window I need to land Charizard without eating a Discharge.","Zapdos used Thunder Wave  // Paralysis drops Chlorophyll Exeggutor from 214 to ~107, under Zapdos' 120 - that flips initiative so I can Roost before being hit, and taxes 25% of its turns forever. Status first, damage second, and it sticks even if they pivot."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 14 —"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor used Psychic!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Zapdos took 107 damage."},{"type":"stat","side":1,"text":"Zapdos's Sp. Def fell!"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Zapdos used Thunder Wave!"},{"type":"status","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor was paralyzed!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."},{"type":"item","side":1,"text":"Zapdos restored a little HP (Leftovers, +12)."}],"after":{"turn":14,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(4)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":0,"max_hp":149,"fainted":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171,"status":"paralysis","active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":21,"max_hp":197,"active":true},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":19,"turn":14,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Exeggutor used Psychic  // The Sp. Def drop just broke the Roost war. Zapdos sits at ~21; even if it moves first and Roosts back to ~120, Psychic at -1 SpD is roughly 160 and kills through the heal. Thunder Wave bought them turn order but not survival, and if it flees instead the same Psychic is 2x on Arbok.","Zapdos used Toxic  // The Sp. Def drop makes the next Psychic 136-160, so even a full Roost to 119 dies - Roost and Toxic both live only on the 25% full-para, but Toxic also puts their healthiest body on a permanent clock. Same survival odds, strictly more value."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 15 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Zapdos used Toxic!"},{"type":"fail","side":1,"text":"But it failed!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor used Psychic!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Zapdos took 21 damage."},{"type":"faint","side":1,"text":"Zapdos fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":15,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(3)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":0,"max_hp":149,"fainted":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171,"status":"paralysis","active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":0,"max_hp":197,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":20,"turn":15,"phase":"replace","actions":["","switched to Raticate  // Raticate outruns the paralysed Exeggutor at 163 to 107 and is the only body that survives a Psychic. It needs one turn for Flame Orb to light up - after that Guts Facade rolls 151-190 and OHKOs Charizard, Arcanine, Venusaur and Victreebel."],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Raticate!"}],"after":{"turn":15,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(3)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":0,"max_hp":149,"fainted":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171,"status":"paralysis","active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":0,"max_hp":197,"fainted":true},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","hp":131,"max_hp":131,"active":true},{"name":"Golbat","hp":0,"max_hp":182,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":21,"turn":15,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Exeggutor used Psychic  // Raticate is a 131-HP body and STAB Psychic is ~118, leaving it around 13 — then its own Flame Orb burn ticks 8 a turn and finishes what I started. Its Facade is still unboosted this turn because the burn has not landed yet, so this is the cheapest possible time to take a hit. Charizard stays at full HP as the guaranteed closer.","Raticate used Crunch  // U-turn hits 4x but would force Arbok in to die to Psychic, and Arcanine's priority Extreme Speed OHKOs Raticate at any HP anyway - so Raticate's health is worth less than a second body. Crunch is 2x and leaves Exeggutor inside Facade range once Flame Orb lights."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 16 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Raticate used Crunch!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor took 87 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":1,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"stat","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor's Defense fell!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor used Psychic!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Raticate took 115 damage."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."},{"type":"item","side":0,"text":"Exeggutor restored a little HP (Leftovers, +10)."},{"type":"status","side":1,"text":"Raticate was burned!"}],"after":{"turn":16,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(2)","sides":[{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":0,"max_hp":149,"fainted":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":33,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":1,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":94,"max_hp":171,"status":"paralysis","active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":67,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"The Apothecary","team":[{"name":"Jynx","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Gengar","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Zapdos","hp":0,"max_hp":197,"fainted":true},{"name":"Arbok","hp":167,"max_hp":167},{"name":"Raticate","h